@startuml If-Cn
title If-Cn information exchange: an observation and a decision, hop by hop
left to right direction
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
}
rectangle "AR-04 Sensor" as SENSOR
rectangle "Adapter (RS-ingest)" as ADAPTER
rectangle "Gateway (SV-08)" as GATEWAY
rectangle "Tracking (SV-01)" as TRACKING
rectangle "Planning (SV-02)" as PLANNING
rectangle "Policy (SV-15)" as POLICY
rectangle "Workflow (SV-16, SV-27)" as WORKFLOW
rectangle "Decider (PT-01, PT-02, PT-08)" as DECIDER
rectangle "Bus (SV-03)" as BUS
rectangle "Journal (SV-04)" as JOURNAL
rectangle "API (SV-23)" as API
rectangle "Peer (AR-05)" as PEER
rectangle "Effector (AR-06)" as EFFECTOR
rectangle "Report (SV-29)" as REPORT

SENSOR --> ADAPTER : native (SD-03, AIS, ADS-B, recorded)
ADAPTER --> GATEWAY : IE-01 DetectionView
GATEWAY --> TRACKING : IE-01 accepted
GATEWAY --> BUS : IE-15 IngestEvent
TRACKING --> PLANNING : IE-02 TrackView
PLANNING --> BUS : IE-14 PlanProposed (IE-04)
PLANNING ..> POLICY : IE-04 (GAP-028)
POLICY ..> WORKFLOW : IE-19 PolicyVerdict
WORKFLOW --> DECIDER : pending approval, rationale
DECIDER --> WORKFLOW : decision (IE-23 over API when remote)
WORKFLOW ..> BUS : IE-16 Decided; IE-18 recorded; IE-20 audit
BUS --> JOURNAL : IE-12 Envelope (SD-01, SD-05)
BUS ..> API : IE-12 frames (SD-07)
API ..> PEER : IE-02 as STANAG 4676 (SD-04) with marking
API ..> EFFECTOR : handoff (GAP-040)
JOURNAL --> REPORT : IE-28 traceable to IE-12 seq
@enduml
